gned}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(13x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(8x)-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(18x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{16}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(8x)-\\frac{1}{36}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(18x)+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-340469/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8a371de4-7c3f-5687-bd3a-d3ab5ab803ce"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-340469"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-340479/selection/b19a14a989f4a972d51068d7adbf9612b87f8992742736e5686ea90c04814c09" :answer/id #uuid "a3588672-ee56-53fb-a422-c9dd388971cf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{22}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(8x)+\\frac{1}{10}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340479/selection/360dcf2bcc0402c34161f750aea070677b291ffc207bea2d15cc6fdf1470b16f" :answer/id #uuid "ad4aa282-27e1-5c47-a1f7-b6542b141886" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{22}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11x)-\\frac{1}{10}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340479/selection/f4531f529384e84fc1033aa2c0386723c7764d49c864ee4d4dd5a5e736614abd" :answer/id #uuid "ddd7ed29-9cc8-5ea5-b120-ef340c8d0c22" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{16}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(8x)+\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340479/selection/234608b30e6dab1b219dddda4288f680a175f71f2361d4d95b4b49aae454468b" :answer/id #uuid "a30dcf0d-0f76-5d3a-b32b-108df2a695dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{22}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(11x)+\\frac{1}{20}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340479/selection/c6bfed5a6585349f5f7ae3510aadbe1936b957b5a80dbd0bdfc90f00d91d6b43" :answer/id #uuid "db194638-5b4c-52e4-aaa5-6c75ca627fc6" :answer/type :answer.t